## ⚠️ 8. Risks (and how to mitigate)

### 🔴 Networking Issues

* Use private endpoints
* Validate NSG rules early

### 🔴 Identity Misconfiguration

* Use group-based RBAC only (no direct user access)

### 🔴 Security Approvals Delay

* Pre-align with security team:

  * VNet design
  * Private link usage
  * Data exfiltration rules

